oethe-mini-2","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, bis wann müssen wir den Antrag fertig haben? Die Frist rückt näher.","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_011_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-11-goethe-mini-2","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Bis Freitag. Ich übernehme die Überarbeitung des Textes, wenn du dich um die Kooperation kümmerst.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_011_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-11-goethe-mini-2","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Abgemacht, ich rufe die Partneruniversität gleich an.","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_011_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-11-goethe-mini-2","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Perfekt, dann schaffen wir das rechtzeitig.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_011_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Bis Freitag. Ich übernehme die Überarbeitung, wenn du die Daten prüfst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-11-goethe-mini-2","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-11-goethe-mini-2","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Timo fragt, bis wann der Antrag fertig sein muss. Teilt die Aufgaben.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Hinsichtlich der Aufgabenteilung bin ich zuversichtlich, trotz der Zeitknappheit.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-11-goethe-mini-2","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-11-goethe-mini-2","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Prüfung, Teil 1: Halte einen kurzen Vortrag zur Zusammenarbeit im Team.","voic